{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人劉愷威自與前妻楊冪離婚後，感情動向一直備受矚目。</p><p>近日他高調認愛小20歲的模特兒黎紀君，瞬間引爆網民熱議。</p><p>劉愷威父親劉丹（丹爺）昨日與馬海倫一同出席公開活動時，開腔回應兒子的新戀情，場面不僅溫馨，更因同行好友的「連環爆料」而笑料百出。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.684926+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T05:32:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"efa10971d2f977987bc6175f3f0df5cf38810d5018f029cc05c466d5588b49a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}